@startuml starbuzz_inheritance_limit3
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

left to right direction

title Starbuzz bez Dekoratora - dziedziczenie (2 kawy, 3 dodatki, max 3 dodatki)

abstract class Beverage

package "Espresso variants" {
  class Espresso
  class EspressoWithMocha
  class EspressoWithSoy
  class EspressoWithWhip
  class EspressoWithMochaSoy
  class EspressoWithMochaWhip
  class EspressoWithSoyWhip
  class EspressoWithMochaSoyWhip
}

package "HouseBlend variants" {
  class HouseBlend
  class HouseBlendWithMocha
  class HouseBlendWithSoy
  class HouseBlendWithWhip
  class HouseBlendWithMochaSoy
  class HouseBlendWithMochaWhip
  class HouseBlendWithSoyWhip
  class HouseBlendWithMochaSoyWhip
}

Beverage <|-- Espresso
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithMocha
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithSoy
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithWhip
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithMochaSoy
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithMochaWhip
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithSoyWhip
Beverage <|-- EspressoWithMochaSoyWhip

Beverage <|-- HouseBlend
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithMocha
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithSoy
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithWhip
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithMochaSoy
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithMochaWhip
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithSoyWhip
Beverage <|-- HouseBlendWithMochaSoyWhip

note bottom
Dla 1 kawy i 3 dodatkow (bez powtorzen, kolejnosc bez znaczenia):
C(3,0) + C(3,1) + C(3,2) + C(3,3) = 8 wariantow.
Dla 2 kaw: 2 * 8 = 16 klas koncowych.
end note

@enduml
